<div class="modal fade" id="edgeModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="modal-title" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold ds-i18n">Quick Calibration Guide</h5>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
      </div>

      <div class="modal-body p-4">
        <p class="mb-3 ds-i18n">Follow these steps in order. <strong>Full instructions are also written at the bottom of this page.</strong></p>

        <div class="mb-3">
          <h6 class="fw-bold ds-i18n">Step 1 — Calibrate Stick Center</h6>
          <p class="mb-0 ds-i18n">Place the controller flat and <strong>do not touch the thumbsticks.</strong> Let them rest at center, then press <em>Calibrate Stick Center.</em></p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-3">
          <h6 class="fw-bold ds-i18n">Step 2 — Calibrate Stick Range</h6>
          <p class="mb-0 ds-i18n">Press <em>Calibrate Stick Range,</em> then slowly rotate both sticks in full circles — at least <strong>2 complete rotations in every direction</strong> — until the <em>Done</em> button appears.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-3">
          <h6 class="fw-bold ds-i18n">Step 3 — Fine-Tune <span class="text-muted fw-normal">(Optional)</span></h6>
          <p class="mb-0 ds-i18n">Use <em>Finetune Stick Calibration</em> and the D-Pad to micro-adjust the center point if needed.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-3">
          <h6 class="fw-bold ds-i18n">Step 4 — Save</h6>
          <p class="mb-0 ds-i18n">Press <em>Save Changes Permanently</em> to write the calibration to the controller.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded text-center mt-3" style="background-color: #000; color: #fff;">
          <p class="fw-bold mb-1 ds-i18n" style="letter-spacing: 0.05em; font-size: 0.9em;">FOR A VIDEO TUTORIAL, VISIT THE QR CODE OR LINK ON YOUR CALIBRATION BOARD</p>
          <p class="mb-0 ds-i18n" style="font-size: 0.85em;">Need help? Text us at <strong>323-680-4706</strong></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="modal-footer">
        <div class="form-check me-auto">
          <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="edgeModalDontShowAgain">
          <label class="form-check-label ds-i18n" for="edgeModalDontShowAgain">Don't show again</label>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary ds-i18n" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Got it — Let's Calibrate</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
